    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lock In</strong> is a truly immersive one of a kind strategy shooter experience. In this realistic setting you will have to prove your skills in combat and strategy to ensure success against the enemy forces. <strong>Lock In</strong> features some long loved and long missed game modes as well as a couple new ones with a twist that will really test your combat savvy. One Game mode &quot;Free for all&quot; is currently enabled, the rest will be enabled in the following weeks to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable Game Types to look forward to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> - with several different game types once all enabled! (Free for all currently Available.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong> (Under Development)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Warfare</strong> (Under Development) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last but not least <strong>Zombies</strong>, an all new kind of Zombie game mode unlike anything you've ever experienced before!\u00a0(Under Development)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lock In</strong> features a <u>Team/Proximity Voice chat</u>. Be careful announcing your plans as your enemy might be around the corner or behind the wall <i>listening in</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This action packed realism shooter features some of the most realistic graphics in the maps you'll be playing on. With tons more maps on the way, as well as even more improvements on realism in the game mechanics underway in development, player controls etc for a truly immersive and challenging experience.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070410/extras/036afd06e6566d299bb50bf29b45b277.avif?t=1755328422\" width=300 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join our DISCORD for special insights on developments, and for your chance to vote on future changes/additions in the game! Discord Link on the right side of the page! &gt;&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to gear up, get ready to set the game plan, and most of all.....   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to <strong>LOCK IN</strong>!</p>",
