m/apps/3070410/extras/036afd06e6566d299bb50bf29b45b277.avif?t=1755328422\" width=300 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join our DISCORD for special insights on developments, and for your chance to vote on future changes/additions in the game! Discord Link on the right side of the page! &gt;&gt;&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to gear up, get ready to set the game plan, and most of all.....   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to <strong>LOCK IN</strong>!</p>",
